fix(timesheet): rework employee & HR timesheets, add review flow, fix CSRF after refresh

Employee timesheet
- Draft timesheets can be edited and deleted; returned drafts can be fixed and resubmitted
- Days already logged in another timesheet stay editable; new entries start after the existing ones
- Retrying a failed "Save & submit" updates the same draft instead of creating a duplicate
- Time slots use whole minutes, so entries no longer overlap or produce "09:60" times
- "Fill" skips leave days, halves half-day leave, tops up partly filled days and keeps extra rows
- Projects match by name or ID and link to the ERPNext Project; typed tasks link to assigned tasks
- Activity Type is filled automatically, so employees no longer hit "Activity Type is mandatory"
- CSV import handles quoted fields, ; and tab separators, US-style dates and header rows (HR export too)
- Warns before switching month or closing with unsaved entries; shows an error if the overlap check fails
- Projects used in recent timesheets are offered as one-click suggestions

HR timesheets
- Hours are counted in the month of each entry, so cross-month sheets show in both months and both CSVs
- Approve or "Return for correction" (cancel + editable copy with HR's note)
- Defaults to submitted timesheets; status filters: awaiting review / approved / draft / all
- CSV export uses data already loaded (no per-sheet requests) and blocks spreadsheet formulas
- Detail view shows free-text notes and ERPNext's own status (Billed, Payslip...)

Shared / fixes
- CSRF token is fetched after a page refresh and on demand, and refreshed once on CSRFTokenError
- Logout always clears the session, even if the server call fails
- My Approvals awaited the wrong value in each request, so the page always failed - fixed
- useAsync clears old data when its inputs change (no previous month shown under a new label)
- Assigned-task search matches the exact email, not part of it
- Dev proxy for /app and /me; role presets updated for timesheet review and draft delete

New files: src/lib/timesheets.js, src/pages/employee/EmpTimesheet.jsx
